The '''Ampurias L''' ({{lang-bl|Ampurias Elevada}}) is an elevated {{W|linear park}} located in the [[Ampurias]] borough of the [[Castejón|Castejón Metropolis]]. It is a component of the [[Castejón Skyway]].

